# Constitution

1. ALPHA scaffold ≠ enterprise READY.
2. No evidence ⇒ UNKNOWN, never PASS.
3. Self-evolution is propose-only; never auto-deploy.
4. Prefer vertical slices with proof over mass stubs.
5. pnpm is the only package manager.
6. Baseline models must be labeled NON-PRODUCTION.
7. Do not rewrite stable contracts without approval.
